00:06:54.997 --> 00:06:58.860
"Why the hell are we using our
forearms to measure stuff"?

00:06:58.860 --> 00:07:00.480
They needed something precise.

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:02.640
Not like barley corns and forearms,

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:03.570
but something that they could

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:05.610
peg their new measurement system to

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:09.007
