00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:52.140
The guy quickly discovered
this, like in the middle of it,

00:09:52.140 --> 00:09:53.790
but he didn't tell anyone because

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:56.910
support for this new system
was already really tenuous,

00:09:56.910 --> 00:09:57.990
